<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP NZ holds 6.65 pct of the Warehouse.</title>
<headline>AMP NZ holds 6.65 pct of the Warehouse.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Investments (NZ) became a substantial security holder in The Warehouse Group Ltd on March 6 with a relevant interest in 6.65 percent of The Warehouse's voting securities, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
